# decTest remainder vectors
#
# Extracted mechanically (scripts noted in SPEC.md) from the IBM / Mike
# Cowlishaw "General Decimal Arithmetic Testcases" v2.62, file remainder.decTest,
# "Reproduced with permission ... Copyright 1997, 2009 by International
# Business Machines Corporation" -- https://speleotrove.com/decimal/dectest.html
# See NOTICE.
#
# Format: id|a|b|expected|expected_exponent
# Test IDs are the source file's, kept for traceability.
#
# Cases NOT wired, and why:
#   79     zero result (module prints bare "0", cannot show GDA signed/scaled zero)
#   67     hard flag, no result in this module (invalid_operation)
#   36     special value (NaN/Inf) or non-numeric operand
#   29     hard flag, no result in this module (division_impossible)
#   13     out of stated bounds (|exp|>10000 or >1000 coeff digits)
#   9      hard flag, no result in this module (division_undefined)
#   5      context-precision flag (Inexact/Rounded)

